            "sid": "JER 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “The time is coming when I will be the God of all the tribes of Israel, and they will be my people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the desert I showed mercy to those people who had escaped death. When the people of Israel longed for rest, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I appeared to them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31.3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "me.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " from far away. People of Israel, I have always loved you, so I continue to show you my constant love. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Once again I will rebuild you. Once again you will take up your tambourines and dance joyfully. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Once again you will plant vineyards on the hills of Samaria, and those who plant them will eat what the vineyards produce. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yes, the time is coming when watchmen will call out on the hills of Ephraim, ‘Let's go up to Zion, to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
