        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", say that the time is coming when I will fill the land of Israel and Judah with people and animals. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And just as I took care to uproot, to pull down, to overthrow, to destroy, and to demolish them, so I will take care to plant them and to build them up. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.18.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 18.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When that time comes, people will no longer say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
