                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “The time is coming when I will make a new covenant with the people of Israel and with the people of Judah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It will not be like the old covenant that I made with their ancestors when I took them by the hand and led them out of Egypt. Although I was like a husband to them, they did not keep that covenant. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 10.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The new covenant that I will make with the people of Israel will be this: I will put my law within them and write it on their hearts. I will be their God, and they will be my people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 10.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None of them will have to teach his fellow-citizen to know the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", because all will know me, from the least to the greatest. I will forgive their sins and I will no longer remember their wrongs. I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
